  "code": "void quickSort(int a[], int lo, int hi) {\n    if (lo >= hi) return;\n    int pivot = a[hi];                          /* 取末元素为基准 */\n    int i = lo - 1;                             /* i 是「小于区」右边界 */\n    for (int j = lo; j < hi; j++) {\n        if (a[j] < pivot) {\n            i++;\n            int t = a[i]; a[i] = a[j]; a[j] = t;\n        }\n    }\n    int t = a[i + 1]; a[i + 1] = a[hi]; a[hi] = t;  /* 基准归位 */\n    int p = i + 1;\n    quickSort(a, lo, p - 1);\n    quickSort(a, p + 1, hi);\n}",
